# Experimental Results – Intelligent Book Recommendation System

## 1. Experimental Setup
Implemented in Python in Kaggle using the Book Recommendation Dataset (`Books.csv`, `Users.csv`, `Ratings.csv`). Libraries include NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib, Seaborn and scikit-learn. Four approaches were implemented: popularity-based, content-based, collaborative filtering and hybrid recommendation.

